        }
      ],
      "words": 26
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "She wanted him gone or she wouldn’t be able to protect herself",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6220
        }
      ],
      "words": 12
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Well, I too am a prisoner of Valletta. I look normal enough, some might even consider me fortunate, but I am trapped all",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6660
        }
      ],
      "words": 59
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "‘I have Danjel, yes. He is the reason I get up each day and breathe, over and over until the next morning.’",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7146
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "‘Not long after you left. A decision was made to protect the city’s most valuable artwork given the damage being done to",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8470
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "If he’s serious, he’ll need a mentor, someone who has years of expertise in his specialty. I can help. I know people.’",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10942
        }
      ],
      "words": 22
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "‘My marriage has been a tremendous disappointment, if I’m being totally honest. We’ve actually separated now. It’s recen",
